<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's JSE sets 1.07 bln rand record turnover.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's JSE sets 1.07 bln rand record turnover.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Johannesburg Stock Exchange on Thursday recorded its highest value traded, turning over 1,068.4 million rand.</p>
<p>The previous record was 999.7 million rand on April 9, 1996.</p>
<p>Dealers said about 300 million rand of turnover could be attributed to a large overnight asset swap on all-shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
